SDK sources: add missing <fstream> includes (GCC-15 class).

counters/metrics.cpp, output/output_stream.hpp (covers its .cpp), and
rocprofiler-sdk-rocpd/sql.cpp use std::ifstream/std::ofstream without
including <fstream>; GCC 15's libstdc++ no longer provides it
transitively -> "variable 'std::ifstream file' has initializer but
incomplete type". Same transitive-include class as the vendored
yaml-cpp/elfio patches, in the SDK's own code. Full-source sweep run;
every other fstream user chains the include through its own headers.

--- a/source/lib/rocprofiler-sdk/counters/metrics.cpp
+++ b/source/lib/rocprofiler-sdk/counters/metrics.cpp
@@ -44,6 +44,7 @@
 
 #include <dlfcn.h>  // for dladdr
 #include <cstdint>
+#include <fstream>
 #include <cstdlib>
 #include <memory>
 #include <vector>
